# Force LF for shell scripts regardless of the checking-out platform's
# core.autocrlf setting - Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which would otherwise check these out with CRLF line endings and break
# them (bad shebang interpreter, malformed tokens) when run via sh/bash
# (Git Bash, WSL2). Shell scripts are the one file type in this repo
# where line endings are not cosmetic.
*.sh text eol=lf
